STRUCTURES:
	- (Possible) Add Deepsap Bay
		-Deepsap Bays allow the player to place two different seeds in the same bay, producing a special plant every so often.
		-This is by far the fatest way to grow any weapon. Deepsap growth is 200% faster, and the output is 2, sometimes even 3, weapons.
		-It's true power lies in fusing different seeds with others, which can produce brand new genomes.
		-Deepsap Bays only lose Deepsap when seeds are present. Once the two seeds are chosen, the deepsap and seeds cannot be changed.
		-Deepsap is extremely rare; it can only be bought from EcoTech traders, and one is given to the player starting scenario.
		-Deepsap will also rarely be produced by tier 2 Conduit Trees (Deeproot).
		-Each Deepsap Bay lasts a year before the sap needs to be replaced.
		-Deepsap cannot grow normal plants, and may later be required for specific plant types.

